We will be converting Saturday night to Enterprise.  We upgraded to du 4.0
quite some time ago and struggled with Internet applications (this is at
an ISP) primarily due to C2 security.  We ran into a couple problems with
Enterprise.  The one that stopped us was that users pages were not accessible.
