Hello All,

I saw the following posting and wanted to pass on some followup.

I believe the hung ADVFS daemon problem referred to affects Digital Unix
4.0B. I encountered it when I upgraded to DU 4.0B, but did not see it
previous DU versions.

There is a fix for that problem on DU 4.0B. The problem is one of the 
many flaws with DECthreads on 4.0B. The needed patch is part of the 
Digital Unix 4.0B patch kit number 3.

			DUV40BAS00003-19970425

