the conclusion that the interface must run at 100, half duplex. 

	The consensus from the replies was to force a 100MB/s half duplex
by issuing a 

		ifconfig tu* speed 100

which I did and now I get ftp and NFS transfers above 3.4MB/s, limited by
disk speed, I think.

