From: "Pam Woods, Systems Manager" <axsymgr () UAA ! ALASKA ! EDU>
Date: Fri, 16 May 1997 18:02:13 +0000
To: tru64-unix-managers
Subject: SUMM:Re: removing u_expdates (new)
