Our biggest problem was that the Sybase administrator was
using a Sybase configuration file that was designed for 
one dataserver.  He simply copied the same file into his
setup for three dataservers.  

His single server environment said to use 1gb of Virtual Memory.
Now he has three servers that are told to use 1gb of VM EACH!!
