From tru64-unix-managers  Fri May 09 17:35:08 1997
From: sanghvi () proto ! wilm ! ge ! com (arun sanghvi)
Date: Fri, 09 May 1997 17:35:08 +0000
To: tru64-unix-managers
Subject: summary- mail.log
